window.products.push({"id":725157,"name":"Kirk Rogers Furniture Company Foot Stool One of a Kind Maple Stain (Made in the USA)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":124.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sj1xWYMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine being able to sit down in your favorite chair and sit back, put your feet up on your one of a kind stool and read or watch TV. What a delight! Everyone knows that putting your feet up is good for your legs and back. If your legs are not supported you will have back problems. This is exactly what is needed. If you like to buy things that are well made and will last a lifetime this foot stool is for you. Hand sanded, handcrafted, made with care, stained with a maple stain & made in the USA. We surveyed Amazon.com and there is NOT any other 4\" foot stool there. Our research found that older vintage foot stools were 4\" high, so that is what we created. Customer success: I purchased one of your maple-stained oak footstools from Amazon last week. From the beginning I was favorably impressed by the fine craftmanship that went into the construction of the footstool. Now that I have been using it for a few days, I confirmed by initial reaction and find that it works well for my purposes. Thank-you for sharing your fine craftmanship with me. A Kirk Rogers Design & Invention. Kirk Rogers an American Inventor that has made his living creating ideas for musical instruments, book holders, sports equipment and kitchen display racks. Feel free to contact me about any idea you would like made.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sj1xWYMoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kirk Rogers Furniture Company","source_asin":"B004XQG5HE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004XQG5HE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004XQG5HE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
