window.products.push({"id":725235,"name":"FRYPLS Cactus Beach Towel,Oversized 100% Microfiber Pool Bath Towel for Girls,Quick Dry and Sand Free,Extra Large Hawaii Blanket for Adults Travel and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+I0vVNcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌊 High Quality Microfiber Material: Our beach towels are made of premium microfiber fabric that is soft, smooth and durable. Each towel weighs 330g, which is heavier than most similar products on the market. Our towels have no odor and are safe for your skin. 🌴 Extra Large Size: Our bath sheets measure 32\"x63\", which is larger than most beach towels on the market. They can cover your whole body or wrap around you comfortably. They are also easy to fold and carry in your bag. 🐚 Anti-Sand Technology: These towels have a special anti-sand feature that prevents sand from sticking to them. You can easily shake off the sand after using them on the beach. No more annoying sand in your car or home! 🎨 Exclusive Original Designs: These bath tissues have unique and colorful patterns that are designed by our own artists. You can choose from mermaid, dinosaur, flamingo, unicorn, turtle and pineapple themes. They are printed with high-quality machines that ensure vivid colors and long-lasting durability. 🎁Versatile Usage: These microfiber towels are not only great for the beach, but also for the pool, travel, camping, fitness and more. You can use them as bath towels, picnic blankets or even gifts for your friends and family. They are suitable for boys, girls and adults of all ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71h+I0vVNcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRYPLS","source_asin":"B09V56VDM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V56VDM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V56VDM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":725236,"name":"Justin Case Countertop Coffee Station Black Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLqDKBAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Coffee Overflow Solution : Introducing a unique and first of its kind way of controlling coffee overflows at your coffee station. This masterpiece designed and manufactured in the United States only by Justin Case Deck is your perfect solution to coffee overflows. Sturdily Built : This Coffee Pot Station Stand is built strong and can comfortably hold 106 oz of carafe weight. So you can place your coffee maker where you want with confidence. Captures Spills large or small : This product is designed to hold over 14 cups of coffee making it impossible to get filled up at single usage before the content is discarded. Protection to your Appliance : Now you can relax with peace of mind while your coffee maker is at work, you have no worries about having your appliances damaged or your furniture, counters and flooring soaked as a result of coffee spills and overflows. Buy With Confidence : Buying this product saves you a lot of time, money and damages.. It's a practical way of spending your money wisely because you never know when next your coffee maker will take some overflow spills. A Coffee maker is a great item to have around. But, have you thought about what could happen next if you're carried away by something else while your coffee maker is still at work? How would you feel when you come back and your expensive household appliances are already soaked in liquids. That's a kind of frustrating experience that you don't ever want to encounter. Now here's great news for you! You can now take some time out engaging in something else while your coffee maker is at work without having any fear of coffee spillage. Thanks to Justin Case Deck's Coffee Pot Station Stand designed to automatically hold all spilling liquids. It works like magic and can hold over 14 cups of coffee without allowing any drop to escape. This is an excellent way to keep your appliances safe and your furniture, tables, walls etc. clean while enjoying your favourite coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RLqDKBAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Justin Case Deck","source_asin":"B014SA4NEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014SA4NEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014SA4NEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
