window.products.push({"id":725345,"name":"Ziqi 100% Heavy Natural Cotton Canvas Tote Bag Washable Perfect for Crafting Decorating Large Foldable Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags Eco Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s9NB5beML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ORGANIC, REUSABLE AND WASHABLE CANVAS GROCERY BAGS: Instead of relying on disposable plastic or paper bags that are bad for the planet, invest in an affordable, and high quality Organic Cotton Reusable Grocery Bag. Unlike other flimsy bags, this is nice and sturdy, and it even has unique bottle sleeves to prevent glass bottles from accidentally banging against each other and breaking. These bags are biodegradable and reusable as well as organic.These bags are biodegradable and reusable as well as organic, meaning that you will not have any waste when you go to the supermarket. They have double stitched top hem, piping stitching on exterior edges and X stitched handles for additional reenforcement. The extra stitching mentioned above adds the to the bag’s durability and strength, ensuring that the bag will not break on you while you shop and can live up to weekly grocery shopping for years. For additional stability, Organic Cotton Mart suggests using thick scrap cardboard as a base. Just cut it to 14x6”, place it in the bottom of the bag, and it should stand up more or less upright for easy loading and unloading. Even better for the planet, once you no longer need the bag or if it begins to wear down years down the road, you can trust that it is biodegradable so it will not sit in a landfill. Expect a permanent shrinkage of about one inch in the width and three-quarters of an inch in width.Premium Cotton Canvas Tote Bags are perfect for any occasion. Whether you use it for a day at the beach, travel, vacationing, or shopping, to catch attention wherever go!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s9NB5beML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ziqi","source_asin":"B07NYWXGVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NYWXGVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NYWXGVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
