window.products.push({"id":725406,"name":"Glass Pitcher with Lid & Removable Fruit Infuser Filter, 105.6OZ Glass Fruit Infuser Water Pitcher with Precise Scale Line & Mix Spoon, HOUSALE 18/8 S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fIeGbFcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ UNIQUE DETACHABLE STAINLESS STEEL INFUSER AND LID - Instead of taking the entire Infuser out, you can just open the lid and refill the fruit and herbs or tea. Importantly when the infuser is removed, the fruit infuser water pitcher can be used as a regular glass pitcher with a lid. Compared with other pitchers using plastic or glass infusers, HOUSALE Pitcher is equipped with a thick stainless steel infuser which is safer and more durable, without worrying about health and breakage. ❤ 105.6OZ AMAZING CAPACITY & PRECISE SCALE LINE - The water infuser pitcher features an exact scale line so you can make precisely the right amount of DIY drinks to meet your needs. Compared with other infused water pitcher precise scale lines can help control capacity. 105.6 ounce large capacity that is enough for everyday use or party serving. ❤ EXTRA BONUS A LONG HANDLE MIXING SPOON AND SPONGE BRUSH - Equipped with a double-ended mixing spoon worth $11.99, you can use it to mix well and make the drink more delicious. Super easy to clean with a value of $9.99 brush, anyone can reach hand in and wash it easily. The infuser pitcher is dishwasher safe, hand washing is recommended. Besides, there will be no peculiar smell after washing thanks to the glass material. ❤ SUPERIOR MATERIAL WATER PITCHER - This iced tea pitcher is made from borosilicate glass which is stronger than regular glass, Thickened bottom and handle make it more durable, Its lid fits snugly against the spout, preventing the loss of fruit tea flavors and the entry of refrigerator odors, BPA free & lead-free, refrigerator safe & stove safe, heat-resistant and withstand temperature -40 to 300 ℉, ideal for both cold and hot drinks. ❤ A WONDERFUL CHOICE AS A GIFT & GUARANTEE - Our glass pitcher is not only practical kitchenware but also an attractive decoration on the table when you make a nice-looking beverage. This is the best choice as a gift. ❤️NOTE❤️In the process of logistics and transportation, it is inevitable that the package is damaged. If you receive a damaged package, please take a photo and send an email. We will send you a new glass pitcher, and you don't need to return the broken item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fIeGbFcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSALE","source_asin":"B0BC1KMGD9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC1KMGD9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC1KMGD9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
