window.products.push({"id":725413,"name":"Messermeister-Made In Germany-Meridian Elite Initial Knife Block Set , 6-Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQ9+ipbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Messermeister Meridian Elité 6 Piece Initial Block Set consists of an 8\" Stealth Chef's Knife (E/3686-8S), 5\" Scalloped Utility Knife (E/3685-5), 3.5\" Paring Knife (E/3691-3.1/2), 9\" Steel (4410-9F), Take-Apart Utility Shears (DN-2070) and 10 Slot Wood Knife Block (SKB-10RW). This is the perfect starter set for your kitchen! Amazon.com As a gift, this set will bring joy to any cook who values fine knives that last a lifetime. Forged from single pieces of high-carbon stainless steel, Messermeister Elite knives are hand sharpened in a three-step process; have shortened bolsters so blades are sharp from tip to heel and a cook's forefinger rests comfortably on them; and feature classic three-rivet, full-tang, seamless polymer handles. The set consists of four knives (8-inch carving, 8-inch chef's, 6-inch utility, and 3-1/2-inch paring); a heavy hardwood block with rubber feet that contains six slots for steak knives and five additional slots for future acquisitions or loyalty to old knives; and a 10-inch sharpening steel, with finger guard and hanging loop, for keeping knife edges in order. Though they're dishwasher- safe, fine knives like these should be hand washed. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQ9+ipbmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Messermeister","source_asin":"B00004XS0M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004XS0M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004XS0M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
