window.products.push({"id":725563,"name":"Auto9 2.5\" Large Electric Grinder: Auto Spice Grinder with auto dispensing, Portable 4 gram Capacity Grinder for food spices with Two-Direction Rocker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LgfBI5byL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spice Kitchen Grinder: Auto9 perfectly combines electronic grinding and auto dispensing. Powerful electric motor which evenly grinds and dispenses spice through a clear cone spout with the press of a button. Innovative powerful grinding technology unlocks hidden tastes, aromas & potency. Brand new rocker technology perfectly simulates hand-grinding movements to produce the fluffy grinding texture you are familiar with. Auto9 provides a reliable and effortless experience. High-Power Electric Grinder: Auto9 grinder is equipped with 15 sharp machines CNC diamond-shaped shredder teeth combined with 180 r/min powerful motors that can effortlessly grind and extract potent aromas and fresh flavors. High rotational speed allows for 20X faster grinding at the touch of a button. A full charge takes 2-3 hours by USB-C charging. A powerful 2000mAh battery allows for hours of continuous usage. A single charge would last for weeks or even months depending on your usage. Ergonomic Design: Auto9 was designed to operate with a single hand, the handle and trigger are perfectly positioned for simple point, press, and done experience. Large 63mm or 2.5\" head combined with the powerful motor allows for a 4g capacity. The cone shape spout allows a cleaning dispensing experience and allows material to be dispensed precisely where you want it. Top grinding teeth and cones spout are both washable and could be separated for ease of cleaning. Gift Set: Auto9 grinder and accessories kit contains all the essentials for a perfect gift set for anyone that can benefit from an effortless and time saving grinding experience. It is perfect for culinary, spice and herbal enthusiast and a must have for traveler and those often on the road. Complete Grinder Accessories Kit: Avoid waste after grinding, the grinder set is equipped with 4 cleaning accessories and 1 funnel loader. Design so gravity and vibration automatically distribute evenly as you tilt and pour herbs on the funnel and use the cleaning accessories after each use for jam and blockage-free grinds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LgfBI5byL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloudious9","source_asin":"B0BRZ4F9Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRZ4F9Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRZ4F9Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
