window.products.push({"id":725742,"name":"Gifts for Mom from Daughter Son, Best Mom Gifts for Mothers Day - Mothers Day Birthday Gifts for Mom, Funny Gifts for Mom, Mom Mothers Day Gift, Laven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SGRloZsmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"A Romantic Gift For Every Occasion The scented candle is the perfect gift for mother, mom gifts, and it makes a romantic and funny gift no matter the occasion, funny Mothers day gifts, birthday gifts for mom, mom gifts for Christmas, mom Valentine gift or any other special occasions. Versatile Aroma That Works In Every Room You can use the aromatic jar candles anywhere, in the bathroom, living room, office room, in your bedroom before sleeping, when having dinner, when taking a bath, when doing yoga or exercising, when studying or working, this aromatherapy candle is perfect to create a relaxing and comfortable atmosphere no matter when or where. A Fun Yet Heartwarming Message The humorous and heartwarming message on the scented candle reads 'Mom, Thanks for being my mom. If I had a different mom, I would punch her in the face and go find you. Love you forever'. It will put a smile on your mom's face every time she read it, and will remind her of how special she is to you. Made By High Standards This soy candle is hand poured and created with natural materials, 100% natural soy wax, pure essential oil and a cotton wick to ensure all the components used on it are natural and safe. The soy candles also burn without smoke for about 45 hours, and it weights about 7oz. Trim the wick to ensure it burns evenly, and could increase the burning time. Lovely Scent The fragrance of the scented candle is a combination of premium fragrance, namely lavender and eucalyptus, smells great but not overpowering. This long-lasting and peaceful floral fragrance promotes sleep and provides relief from anxiety and depression to make you feel relaxed and happy. Finally, the packaging itself is lovely and elegant.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SGRloZsmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AREOK","source_asin":"B0BRXDGH1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXDGH1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXDGH1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":725743,"name":"SlumberCool Mattress Protector, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MrgXDhttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The SlumberCool Protector features a treated fabric capable to respond dynamically to environmental changes like temperature and moisture levels creating a cool, dry, comfortable microclimate for sleep. SlumberCool Protector also features Breathe-a-Barrier, a laminating technology formulated to facilitate the flow of air without absorbing liquids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MrgXDhttL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SlumberCool","source_asin":"B00T6G83WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T6G83WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T6G83WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":725744,"name":"Cardew Design Alice in Wonderland Rectangular Porcelain Tray, 12 by 6-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yBcy+DyAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Paul Cardew was encouraged to explore his talents as a child by Michael Cardew, his great uncle and renowned ceramic designer, or when he later attended the art school at the prestigious Loughborough University in the heart of England. Paul first began teaching art part-time at Exeter University where he had time to develop his skills. Paul Cardew's was asked to design ceramic brooches for Harrods Department store in London and traditional dinnerware brands like Portmeirion, Royal Doulton, Lilliput Lane, Harmony Kingdom- to name but a few. But his greatest claim was an association with The Walt Disney Company, with over one hundred designs perfected during a six year period, launching Paul on to the world's stage. Roy Disney selected Paul Cardew as one of only a few artists worldwide to design special products for Disney's Millennium reproduction of the Fantasia Cartoon. Paul was invited to attend the movies premier at the Royal Albert Hall in London. Many of Paul Cardew old designs are now antiques and are featured in auctions wherever ceramic art and teapots turn up. Today Paul Cardew continues to create even more interesting designs appealing to the ever changing tastes of the discerning consumer. Click on Cardew to see the full range of the Alice collections or others sold here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yBcy+DyAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cardew","source_asin":"B00G3FW4NW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G3FW4NW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G3FW4NW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
