window.products.push({"id":725757,"name":"Sola Wood Flower - Barkie Smalls- Assortment","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91a3v4w8EXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Some of the most interesting flowers made from sola wood are what we call the “bark sola flowers” these flowers are ones that have the skin or bark of the root of the sola wood left on to make a two-toned flower. Want to work with a variety of small skin flowers? This is the assortment for you! This assortment is nothing but bark sola flowers for you to enjoy. Features: 50 flowers sizes ranging from 1.5- 2 inches random pick of different style flowers no two orders will be the same Please note these sola wood flowers are handmade and there can be a slight difference in size and shape from flower to flower. Sola flowers are not fresh flowers. They are handmade wood flowers. The texture is similar to a thin version of balsa wood. Because they are handmade and made from natural materials, no two are exactly alike! Brown veining, occasional small holes from a \"knot\" in the wood are on the flowers. Please note that these flowers do not come with stems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91a3v4w8EXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oh You're Lovely","source_asin":"B07WJFN7ZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WJFN7ZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WJFN7ZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
