window.products.push({"id":725919,"name":"Koya's Oudh Premium Incense Sticks, Pack of 20 Sticks, 23 cm Long, Hand Crafted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OgdpXfaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Product To give our customers the best of Koya's Since 1976 Year's aromatic experience, we bring to you the triple aromas.Made for a new generation that is modern and fresh, we present three variations of this new age scent. Brute, to bring out the musk and powerful aroma of confidence and strength. Spice, to capture the fun, loving environment around you and entice you with its scent, and finally the sweet smell of fragrant talc, to bring you comfort and put you at constant ease in your surroundings. Pick up our Zella to enjoy endless aromatherapy. Benefits of Using Incense Sticks: 1. Incense purifies the mental and physical bodies. 2. Incense rids impurities and brings harmony. 3. Incense alerts the mind and senses. 4. Incense serves as a companion in solitude. 5. Incense brings peace and calms the mind when busy. What Is Oudh? Oudh comes from the wood of the tropical Agar(Aquilaria) tree, which includes 15 different species. The tree is believed to have originated in the Assam region of India and it spread from there to populate Bangladesh and much of Southeast Asia. The wood chips are often burned as an incense.They're often used during religious ceremonies and various celebrations throughout Southeast Asia and the Middle East,including China,Japan and India Koyas Incense sticks have the best Oudh incense sticks in the industry. We have hand crafted this beautiful aroma into a hand-rolled incense sticks. Oudh is one of the most expensive perfume ingredients in the world. It has an intoxicating musky scent that can be quite potent and has been used for centuries in India, Southeast Asia and the Middle East. Today, many perfumers in the West are using it as a base to create some amazing fragrances for men and women.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OgdpXfaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koya's","source_asin":"B07VHTF442","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-725919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHTF442","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHTF442","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
